        dcterms:description "Module and function docstrings map every governing equation to Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. Eqs. 1-6, Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol., Buss (2001) Evol. Dev., and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_100_hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net.lean` (L1-56, L196-497)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
